WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.640
That girl... Ernesta...

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.110
is a demon!

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.820
A demon?

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.910
Tried to win another one over by omitting 
all the bad parts of your story, did you?

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:19.410
Why don't you tell her how 
you ruined my household?

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.600
Tell her!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.580
Tell her how you tried to take over
 my family to defend your own!

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.090
Shingetsu-chan?

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:35.800
Well? You could at least tell her 
whether or not it's true, couldn't you?

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.440
It... is...

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.220
not true.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.330
If that's how it appeared 
to you, I can't help that,

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:45.940
but it was not my intention to—

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.530
Are you not ashamed of 
such barbaric behavior?

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.900
Be quiet!

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.110
I'll say it as many times as it takes.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.660
You cannot win.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.950
You cannot defeat me.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:18.970
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:18.970
The Two Princeps

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.140
U-Um...

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.380
What is that sound?

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.300
What sound?

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.800
Open your mouth.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.720
No... It's not you.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:50.640
What's not me?

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.900
The mage's descendant.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.850
Mage?

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:01.200
I swear! How long are they gonna 
make me stay in middle school?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.080
Who's that?

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.790
In the late 18th century,

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.570
the British Industrial Revolution lead to

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.980
a wave of industrialization...

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.780
Ever since all the magic 
in the world was lost,

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:21.750
mage families have attempted 
to keep their bloodlines alive

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.000
by allying with other powerful mage families,

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.680
so that they might prolong their survival.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.640
I see...

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.480
This strategy often takes on a form
 that resembles a takeover,

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.930
and can end in misunderstandings.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:37.470
...signed the Treaty of Nanking,

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:42.280
forcing them not only to open their 
ports, but to cede Hong Kong.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:41.730
<i>I guess it's not easy to be a mage...</i>

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.120
When Japan learned of China's disadvantage,

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.490
the bakufu of 1842...

00:03:52.110 --> 00:03:54.400
For today's lunch, I made...

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:58.210
Tonkatsu!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.920
It's... brown.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.460
Have you ever had it before, Shingetsu-chan?

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:08.760
It's the best! It'll make you 
glad you were born Japanese!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.730
I have heard of it. It's 
basically fried pork, right?

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.900
Nope! Fried pork doesn't have this on it.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.570
There!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:21.610
Oh, by the way, never use tonkatsu sauce. 
It's Worcestershire sauce all the way!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.550
Well?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:27.790
It's fine.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.990
It's delicious!

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:36.080
More importantly, I hate to repeat 
myself, but are you absolutely sure?

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.160
Huh?

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.660
About GRANBELM.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.840
Should we talk about that here?

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.460
Don't worry. No one can hear us.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.000
I've made sure of that.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:52.120
There's still some time 
before the next full moon.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.310
You could still...

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.350
Yeah...

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.270
But I still...

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:01.470
I see.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.040
I'm sorry. I do understand how you feel...

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:10.110
But if I quit now, I know I'll regret it.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:11.740
Understood.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.470
So long as you are qualified,

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.830
there's no reason for me to stop you.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:21.430
Thanks. Sorry for being so selfish.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.760
There's no need to apologize.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.290
Yeah...

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.720
Stay calm, Clare!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:43.820
That's right, Ernesta. 
It's all about balance.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.850
You must accept what is found in nature

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:48.740
and adapt your own strengths to it.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.640
Give it a try.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.420
You've improved yet again.

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:08.900
Yes! The teacher said I might win
 at the next competition!

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.140
Shingetsu?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:17.140
I just saw Shingetsu walking by!

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.720
Do you have some free time today?

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:21.860
I don't have any special plans.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.390
If you intend to take part in GRANBELM,

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:26.310
there are preparations you must make.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.490
Ernesta!

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.550
I finally found you!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.050
Where have you been?!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.280
Ma'am...

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.370
Ernesta...

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:39.980
I'm sorry.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:44.240
Anna and Clare are waiting. 
You must come back to us now.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.710
Anna?

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.960
Forgive me. I can no longer...

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.210
Why?

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:55.500
Grandmother and I have 
already agreed to adopt you.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.520
Wouldn't that be beneficial to you, as well?

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.440
Shingetsu!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.870
Clare...

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.190
It's Shingetsu! It's Shingetsu!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.530
Hey, guess what! My next competition...

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.020
I'm sorry.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.820
Shingetsu?

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:18.950
Shingetsu-chan!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.790
Ernesta...

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:44.190
Your house still amazes me, Nene-chan.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.720
Does it?

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.660
You live alone, right? Don't you get lonely?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.020
Not really.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:00.620
Unlike you, I'm not a child.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.480
You always say that.

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:06.000
Obviously! I actually am an adult, you know!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.700
Looks tasty!

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:10.980
Hey...

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.340
Why do you follow me around all the time?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.830
'Cause I get to eat yummy food!

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.600
Just kidding. You're just a really 
difficult girl, Nene-chan.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:30.400
Right from the start, you gave off a vibe 
like you didn't want anyone near you.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.860
And how is that a good thing to you?

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.430
It is!

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:38.300
It's a hundred million times better than 
people who get along with everyone.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.430
Don't give me that creepy smile.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.370
Hey! I wanna eat more!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.040
I never said you could have it!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.590
Open wide, Nene-chan!

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:49.690
Cut it out!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.860
In here should do.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:00.810
I'm just touching your 
memories, the same as before.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.540
Go on.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:02.350
Okay.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.310
What's this?

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.900
This is just practice.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:13.590
Envision being in WHITE LILY, 
like you were last time.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.850
O-Okay.

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.240
What you see are your memories.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.480
You can move them around as you like.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.120
I'll teach you the basic 
pilot controls later,

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.210
but what's important is to envision it.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.920
If your vision is strong enough,

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.430
the mech will naturally 
teach you how to pilot it.

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:50.690
What is it?

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.500
You had no idea they loved 
you that much, did you?

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.220
Her mom and sister, I mean.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.120
But in Anna's mind, I'm...

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.580
You're not a demon.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.720
That's how I feel.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.060
<i>The sound, the taste, the smell...</i>

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:24.960
<i>The faintest of changes in the air 
as the moon waxes and wanes...</i>

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:28.840
<i>That sound...</i>

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.590
<i>No... That must be something different.</i>

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.990
<i>Ten days left until the next full moon...</i>

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.400
Onee-chan...

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:13.130
I haven't even had a chance to fight yet.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.550
Clare!

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.430
<i>Five more hours...</i>

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.520
Let's see...

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.560
I did it!

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.650
How was that?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.070
You've gotten much better.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:04.500
The more I learn about 
this, the more fun it is!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.120
It's so late already...

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:12.770
Yes. The moon will rise at 6:13 PM tonight,

00:12:12.770 --> 00:12:15.040
and will set at 4:28 AM,

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.320
meaning the battle lasts about ten hours.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:19.130
I need to make my own preparations.

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.540
Okay.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:23.050
Shingetsu-chan!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.260
What is it?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:29.300
Never mind. See you later.

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.750
<i>This atmosphere...</i>

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.650
<i>This restless feeling that comes 
along with the full moon...</i>

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:45.330
<i>The sensation that something is 
tightly enveloping my entire body...</i>

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:50.120
<i>If this is the power retained by all 
of us who are mages' descendants,</i>

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.660
<i>the power to sense magic...</i>

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.750
Call forth the mages to this land!

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:01.880
Call forth the crystal of human wisdom!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.010
Call forth all the magic that has been lost!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.470
Call all of us who possess 
that power into you!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.360
<i>These are... my feelings...</i>

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.370
It's not like before...

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:51.390
<i>Correct. The illusionary 
world of Magiaconatus</i>

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:55.920
<i>is created when our memories react to 
the magical power that fills this space.</i>

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:59.940
<i>This world itself most likely exists within 
someone's heart or memory, as well.</i>

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:02.730
In someone's heart...

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:06.120
<i>The battle has begun. Be alert.</i>

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:06.900
Okay.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.200
<i>Also...</i>

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.950
What were you about to ask me?

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:10.890
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:13.000
You started to ask me something earlier.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.290
You should finish things you begin to say.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:21.390
Oh, well... I was just wondering 
why you fight in this battle.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:22.000
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.730
You don't seem interested in becoming a mage,

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.220
so I thought maybe there was another reason.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.320
<i>I'm sorry! It's okay! You 
don't have to answer—</i>

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:35.130
I want to end it.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:35.880
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:39.700
If there was no magic... 
If this power didn't exist,

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:43.980
then this battle, and all the hatred
 and jealousy would...

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.050
That's why?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:51.200
I want to become the Princeps mage,

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:55.890
and use that magical power 
to truly erase all magic

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:59.380
and mages from this world once and for all.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:02.330
I want to erase the potential for them.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:04.880
I'm glad...

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:06.920
<i>For what?</i>

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.520
That you're you.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:19.600
Mangetsu!

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.310
ACONITE GRIS!

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:28.900
I'll never forgive you! I'll never 
forgive you, Ernesta!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.370
You wrapped my mother and my little 
sister around your little finger!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.700
You think so little of me!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.370
You went so far just to make a fool of me!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.700
<i>I didn't! That was just your own—</i>

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.410
And now you dare deny it?!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.250
Shingetsu-chan!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:50.380
Mangetsu!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.880
You think I'll let you get away?!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.980
Eat your fill of this!

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.500
So barbaric...

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:12.070
Shut up!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.830
She's gone hysterical. What a hassle.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.740
<i>Suishou!</i>

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:19.970
Yikes!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.150
C-Can't help right now.
 I'm in the middle of a fight.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:24.170
Bye-bye!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.380
Are you serious?

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:31.340
<i>Nana and I ran the simulation.</i>

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.300
If you continue under
 the current conditions,

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:36.800
your chance of winning is 0.5%.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.890
<i>That's low!</i>

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.610
In a battle with these rules assigned,

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:43.850
JI GUAN LONG, which specializes in 
ranged combat, is at a disadvantage.

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:47.020
That's why we stayed in hiding for 
a year to strategize, remember?

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.260
Well, how was I supposed to know?

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:52.810
The moment I set foot in this 
world, this is what happened.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:55.180
Your ARMANOX is basically another you.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.030
And since you're such a hermit...

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:00.120
That's why we told you to get a boyfriend.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.950
Where do you get off dissing 
your older sister?!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.030
GRANBELM is more important right now!

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:07.040
Right, about that...

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:12.380
Nana and I have been looking into JI GUAN 
LONG's abilities based on this past year's data.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.890
<i>I must become a mage,</i>

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.690
<i>and lift that curse...</i>

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:35.070
<i>The curse on my sister.</i>

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.890
<i>Please...</i>

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:07.560
This is... my ARMANOX...

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.120
SETSGETS BAIKA.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.040
Shingetsu-chan!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.520
No fair ganging up on me!

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.080
<i>Anna Fugo's family descends from</i>

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:33.170
<i>the Carmine Witch, the greatest
mage in southern Europe.</i>

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:35.880
<i>Those may be decoys, but you 
can't underestimate their power.</i>

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.410
<i>Focus your will!</i>

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:40.010
<i>Make this overflowing 
magical power work for you!</i>

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.470
Focus my will...

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:06.410
Envision it!

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:22.510
A-ha!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:33.610
My magical power...

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:36.190
It hasn't recovered from 
the damage I took last time?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.450
As I thought!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:50.080
Just so you know, I haven't the slightest 
interest in fighting fair and square!

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:54.920
All that matters to me 
is that I eliminate you!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.010
I will use ACONITE GRIS to 
impale you, to <i>slaughter</i> you!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.010
And then...

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:03.840
Shingetsu-chan!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.570
I will impale you... slaughter you...

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:22.500
I will erase you from this world!

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:34.030
I used Embers too much!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.290
My magical power...

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.420
A new ARMANOX...

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:49.860
Onee-chan...

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.910
I can hear Onee-chan.

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.160
I can smell her.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.430
What?

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:40.430
Onee-chan... I will...

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:57.480
I didn't know there was one like this...

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:22.870
<i>Wait for me,</i>

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:24.480
<i>Mother.</i>

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:57.770 --> 00:24:00.000
<i>An ARMANOX reflects one's soul.</i>

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>They manifest as avatars 
of these girls' souls.</i>

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:09.050
<i>Nene, who pilots JI GUAN LONG, 
